    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13152" root="دمن" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَدَمَانٌ</span></b> : see what next precedes, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَمَانٌ</span>.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هذا مدمنهم</span> [thus in the TA: app. either
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَدْمِنُهُمْ</span>, and if so meaning <i>This is their place of
continuance,</i> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدَمَّنُهُمْ</span>, meaning <i>the place where
their cattle dung and stale</i>].

